        "body": "roachtest.django [failed](https://teamcity.cockroachdb.com/buildConfiguration/Cockroach_Nightlies_RoachtestNightlyGceBazel/12040022?buildTab=log) with [artifacts](https://teamcity.cockroachdb.com/buildConfiguration/Cockroach_Nightlies_RoachtestNightlyGceBazel/12040022?buildTab=artifacts#/django) on master @ [a227d7867b16e38ecd1b0b61bb2688ac566eb6ee](https://github.com/cockroachdb/cockroach/commits/a227d7867b16e38ecd1b0b61bb2688ac566eb6ee):\n\n\n```\n(django.go:55).func1: pq: changing cluster setting \"kv.raft_log.synchronization.unsafe.disabled\" may cause cluster instability or data corruption.\nTo confirm the change, run the following command before trying again:\n   SET unsafe_setting_interlock_key = 'SyFYeg==';\ntest artifacts and logs in: /artifacts/django/run_1\n```\n<p>Parameters: <code>ROACHTEST_arch=amd64</code>\n, <code>ROACHTEST_cloud=gce</code>\n, <code>ROACHTEST_cpu=16</code>\n, <code>ROACHTEST_encrypted=false</code>\n, <code>ROACHTEST_fs=ext4</code>\n, <code>ROACHTEST_localSSD=true</code>\n, <code>ROACHTEST_ssd=0</code>\n</p>\n<details><summary>Help</summary>\n<p>\n\n\nSee: [roachtest README](https://github.com/cockroachdb/cockroach/blob/master/pkg/cmd/roachtest/README.md)\n\n\n\nSee: [How To Investigate \\(internal\\)](https://cockroachlabs.atlassian.net/l/c/SSSBr8c7)\n\n\n\nSee: [Grafana](https://go.crdb.dev/roachtest-grafana/teamcity-12040022/django/1696375992922/1696376160800)\n\n</p>\n</details>\n/cc @cockroachdb/sql-foundations\n<sub>\n\n[This test on roachdash](https://roachdash.crdb.dev/?filter=status:open%20t:.*django.*&sort=title+created&display=lastcommented+project) | [Improve this report!](https://github.com/cockroachdb/cockroach/tree/master/pkg/cmd/internal/issues)\n</sub>\n\n\nJira issue: CRDB-32026",
